      "writtenOn": "2025-08-01T13:25:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, but I prefer to keep the name, so that it matches with the extension point class name, which is LabelType. This is also consistent with all the other names in this class, e.g. `submitRequirements` is also not prefixed with `global` although it provides the global submit requirements.",
